  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Goety &amp; Cataclysm </strong>是一款用於<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goety\" rel=\"nofollow\">Goety</a>與<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a>之間的相容模組，讓你能夠解鎖後者模組中強大怪物的災難性法術與能力！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/09cd58a56c92d7b09093ec6802aba037d2c3f9f5.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"391\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Discord：</strong></h3>\n<p>我的 Discord 伺服器：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/utQqkWUuDc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/utQqkWUuDc</a></p>\n<h3><strong>贊助：</strong></h3>\n<p>歡迎請我喝杯咖啡：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/polarice3\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/polarice3</a></p>\n<h3><strong>致謝</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>- L_Ender, 《L_Ender's Cataclysm》的開發者。</strong> <strong></strong></p>",
